OL,3,GNEWSATop GCSE results in Wales see
OL,4,Aslight increase after major changes to
OL,5,Aqualifications
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales' main exam board, the WJEC, said
OL,8,Fahead of the results it had done
OL,9,F"everything that we can" to ensure
OL,10,Fresults were "fair and balanced for all
OL,11,Flearners".
